<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss stocks end higher.</title>
<headline>Swiss stocks end higher.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss shares closed slightly higher but near the sessions lows, giving up some gains despite a firmer Wall Street opening.</p>
<p>Attention centered on CS Holding and Electrowatt. Dealers were disappointed with the sluggish performance given good fundamentals, strong U.S. markets and rising bonds.</p>
<p>The blue chip SMI index ended 9.1 points, or 0.23 percent, higher at 3,889.9. The SMI had hit an intraday high of 3,903.6. The all share Swiss Performance Index rose 5.92 points, 0.24</p>
<p>Transmission was aborted</p>
